{title: The Long Road Home}
{artist: Sample song}
{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Morning light is [G]falling on the [Am]road
[F]Every step is [C]bringing us back [G]home
{end_of_verse}
{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F]Carry on, [C]carry on
[G]We can hear the [Am]morning song
{end_of_chorus}
{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]When the night is [G]quiet we will [Am]know
[F]All the roads we [C]travel lead us [G]home
{end_of_verse}
{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F]Carry on, [C]carry on
[G]We can hear the [Am]morning song
{end_of_chorus}
